# SPA fallback.
#
# The app has client-side routes (/settings) and an OAuth redirect URI at
# /auth/callback. Without this rule a static host returns 404 for both: a
# reloaded or bookmarked settings page breaks, and the authorization code is
# never redeemed, so cloud storage silently cannot be connected.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 302: the browser must keep the /auth/callback URL and its
# ?code=… query string so the app can read them.
/*    /index.html   200
